aurepas Foods","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"Zi-F-YvyVOK0k5QD7lrLOg","name":"Muriel's Jackson Square","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"pKykk7lnD6Tf9wSzJYRyJA","name":"Starbucks","shared_categories":"Food","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"JhpRI9m71ybWHkAqRdL0Tg","name":"The Avenue Pub","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"AU-B663F3MPO7W-goWwwXA","name":"B Mac's","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0}],"text":[{"business_id":"Hd_SIjvFQbcPuTwnKeiNuA","review_id":"z6As2aTVuHGPmp8YzK-8rQ","date":"2019-06-27T14:44:04","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9400771260261536,"text_excerpt":"Tacos are my favorite and I have had quite a few in new orleans area. Rosalita's is my favorite taco spot. Most importantly, the tacos are the best in the city. Rosalita's tacos are not overly complicated like some other taco spots, yet they are still flavorful. The flavor of the pork in particular is spectacular (and it happens to be the least expensive one so load up!). All served on traditional corn tortilla that is perfectly cooked - not hard or mushy. Topped with a light cabbage slaw. Not drowning in cheese or sauces. They offer the perfect selection of everything you'd want at a taco spot (amazing from a small operation). All the meats (chicken, pork, brisket, and even chorizo), fis..."},{"business_id":"Hd_SIjvFQbcPuTwnKeiNuA","review_id":"lZNx9ddFEbJ6MgifsrrUMQ","date":"2020-02-16T01:50:03","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9364457726478577,"text_excerpt":"This place has amazing tacos! It's definitely a place to take food to-go or to not mind eating on a chair. The food is so good that it doesn't matter how casual it is. You order at the window and it's cash only but so inexpensive. I love the decor. I was excited that it was spicy too. I could eat here almost everyday."},{"business_id":"Hd_SIjvFQbcPuTwnKeiNuA","review_id":"0j-4bi48Sqg0p3Zozv-sKg","date":"2021-02-07T15:35:25","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.935955286026001,"text_excerpt":"The tacos and nachos from Rosalita's are AMAZING! In my top 3! The meat is perfectly smoked and soooooo tender. All of the sauces were tasty, but not really needed. You know how you have a beautifully decorated room and you add a throw just to have an extra pop. Well, that's the sauce!!! Everything is fresh! Did I say DELICIOUS?!? All drinks are very tasty. We had alcoholic drinks & non-alcoholic drinks. Both were nice on the palette. The watermelon drink seemed to be made with fresh fruit. Loved it! The yard (dining area-there small sitting inside, but I don't think it is currently used due to Covid-19 restriction) is really nice. It was a chilly day, but the outdoor heaters kept us comf..."}],"visual":[{"business_id":"Hd_SIjvFQbcPuTwnKeiNuA","photo_id":"GSLjT0sm42dvIcByurj34Q","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/GSLjT0sm42dvIcByurj34Q.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.874600887298584},{"business_id":"Hd_SIjvFQbcPuTwnKeiNuA","photo_id":"gF0DD5RPNA7csoDiuX0emQ","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/gF0DD5RPNA7csoDiuX0emQ.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8631723523139954},{"business_id":"Hd_SIjvFQbcPuTwnKeiNuA","photo_id":"69XU1XjexrxEFNqRONXyUA","label":"outside","image_url":"/photos/69XU1XjexrxEFNqRONXyUA.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.86097252368927},{"business_id":"Hd_SIjvFQbcPuTwnKeiNuA","photo_id":"IVGxZHeQ0R587pI_kODnmA","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/IVGxZHeQ0R587pI_kODnmA.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.7676541209220886}]},"notebook_case":null}
